The '''Reaper Pepper''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Permanent Consumable]] item used to increase the player's max {{Stat|hp}} and {{Stat|cr}}.

== Obtaining ==
A Reaper Pepper has a {{Green|0.0002182539%}} ({{Green|1/458,182}}) chance to be generated per item harvested by an [[Inferno Minion]] while it is using {{Legendary}} (Hypergolic) [[Inferno Minion Fuel]].

== Usage ==
Up to 5 Reaper Peppers can be consumed to permanently gain {{Green|+1}} {{Stat|hp}}, {{Green|+1}} {{Stat|cr}} and {{SBXP|10}} per Pepper.

