== Trivia ==
*The Reaper Pepper is likely a reference to the [[w:Carolina Reaper|Carolina Reaper]], the world's second-hottest pepper according to the [[w:Guinness World Records|Guinness World Records]], measuring up to 2.2 million [[w:Scoville scale|Scoville heat units]].

